  "source": "TRANSLATION shape: the prompt embeds the complete C++ demo_MBS_fourbar.cpp (projectchrono/chrono src/demos/mbs, copy in source/; the Irrlicht GUI slider class is part of what must be recognized as non-physics and dropped) and the candidate emits an equivalent headless PyChrono script. Bands anchored to the independent loop-closure oracle in oracle.py (circle-intersection sweep with branch continuity + collinear-extreme closed form); Chrono agrees to 4-5 decimals on the pinned build. The demo starts AT the extended collinear extreme, so alpha_min ~ 0 by construction",
  "scoring": {
    "weights": {"L1": 0.30, "L2": 0.20, "L3": 0.50},
